      "output": "char: 'K' | Size: 1 byte | ASCII: 75\nint: 22 | Size: 4 bytes\nunsigned int: 4000000000 | Size: 4 bytes\nfloat: 3.14159 | Size: 4 bytes\ndouble: 3.141592653589793 | Size: 8 bytes\nINT_MAX: 2147483647, INT_MIN: -2147483648",
